[events]
// Right wall, right column and the right half of the slabs on storeys 1-3.
at 90: explode 556 426 16 240
at 98: explode 556 404 16 240
at 105: explode 506 412 16 220
at 112: explode 482 404 14 220
at 120: explode 556 382 16 240
at 135: explode 506 372 16 220
at 142: explode 482 364 14 220
at 150: explode 556 350 16 240
at 158: explode 556 330 14 240
at 165: explode 506 336 14 220
// Left timber column on storey 1.
at 185: explode 454 424 14 220
// Left wall on storey 1, half a second later: the tower comes free.
at 215: explode 406 422 12 240
// Landing charges (impact at tick 479): placed on the slab-column junctions
// and walls of the fallen tower, using the tower's pose at the impact, and
// fired as a ripple from the base to the roof over the next quarter second.
// They break the shattered chunks into rubble and set the timber alight.
at 488: explode 788 331 18 255
at 488: explode 771 435 16 255
at 487: explode 746 329 16 255
at 487: explode 733 287 16 255
at 486: explode 708 337 16 255
